  "bodyHash": "pgYK5PXWRdY=",
  "content": "<div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#fc0;text-decoration:underline\">More Ores In ONE 新增來自新礦物的工具與盔甲，這些礦物可在<span style=\"color:#0cf;text-decoration:underline\">主世界</span>、<span style=\"color:#f60;text-decoration:underline\">地獄</span>與<span style=\"color:#f0f;text-decoration:underline\">終界</span>中找到。</span></span></strong></span></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;color:#000;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">由於這是社群模組，我們希望聽到您對新增或現有礦物的想法，並將盡力實現您的創意！</span><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">您可以在留言區或<a style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://github.com/TheKiritoPlayer20/MoreOresInONE/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\">GitHub</span></a>上提交建議與錯誤回報</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://github.com/TheKiritoPlayer20/MoreOresInONE/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">！</a></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fc0\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></strong></span></span></h2>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">本模組基本上是<span style=\"color:#fc0\"><a style=\"color:#fc0;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/super-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">超級工具</a></span>的擴充套件，但亦可獨立使用！</span></strong></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">新增礦物：<br></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">寶石類：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">紅寶石 - <span style=\"font-style:italic\">紅色綠寶石</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">藍寶石 - <span style=\"font-style:italic\">藍色綠寶石</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">黃玉 - <span style=\"font-style:italic\">地獄鑽石</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\">寒冰礦 - 冰封水晶</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">紫水晶 - <span style=\"font-style:italic\">終極寶石</span></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>其他：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">經驗礦</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">新增礦物說明：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>紅寶石礦：</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -生成於炎熱生態域（沙漠、惡地及其他溫度高於1.0*的生態域）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -生成高度介於0至16層（與鑽石相同）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -最大礦脈大小為8</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -需鐵鎬（挖掘等級2）或更高級工具開採</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>藍寶石礦：</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -生成於寒冷生態域（針葉林、海洋及其他溫度低於0.2*的生態域）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -生成高度介於0至16層（與鑽石相同）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -最大礦脈大小為8</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -需鐵鎬（挖掘等級2）或更高級工具開採</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>黃玉礦：</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -生成於地獄</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -生成高度介於0至128層</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -最大礦脈大小為4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -需鑽石鎬（挖掘等級3）或更高級工具開採</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>紫水晶礦：</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -生成於終界</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -基本上就是<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">終局</span>礦物</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -生成高度介於0至128層</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -需黃玉鎬（挖掘等級4）或更高級工具開採</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">寒冰礦：</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">   -生成於藍冰塊中（例如冰刺之地生態域）<br>   -最大礦脈大小為4<br>   -需鐵鎬（挖掘等級2）或更高級工具開採</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>經驗礦：</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">-</span>生成於主世界、地獄與終界，高度介於0至128層（預設每個區塊最多5個）<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -需石鎬（挖掘等級1）或更高級工具開採</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -開採時有50%機率獲得少量經驗，50%機率獲得大量經驗</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -可透過幸運附魔增加獲得量</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -經驗量：終界經驗礦＞地獄經驗礦＞主世界經驗礦</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">*詳見<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.gamepedia.com%252fBiome\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.gamepedia.com/Biome</a>獲取更完整的炎熱與寒冷生態域列表。只要溫度符合，紅寶石與藍寶石也會在其他模組的生態域中生成！</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">新增工具說明：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">紅寶石與藍寶石工具效能近似鑽石，但速度稍快、傷害略高且耐久度更高。可用紅寶石/藍寶石修復。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">黃玉工具挖掘等級為4（高於鑽石），耐久度1800，速度略快於紅寶石/藍寶石工具，傷害更高且附魔能力稍強。可用黃玉修復。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">寒冰工具耐久度400，速度略快於鐵製工具，挖掘等級為2。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">紫水晶工具挖掘等級同為4，耐久度2000，速度比黃玉工具更快，傷害更高且附魔能力優於黃玉工具。可用紫水晶修復。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">新增盔甲套裝說明：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">紅寶石、藍寶石、黃玉與紫水晶盔甲提供完整護甲值</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">全套黃玉盔甲賦予火焰抗性</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">寒冰盔甲提供9.5點護甲值</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">全套紫水晶盔甲額外賦予火焰抗性與抗性效果</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">新增馬鎧說明：</span></span></span></p><ul>\n<li>藍寶石與紅寶石馬鎧提供與鑽石馬鎧相同的11點護甲值</li>\n<li>黃玉馬鎧提供13點護甲值</li>\n<li>紫水晶馬鎧提供18點護甲值</li>\n<li>所有新馬鎧均可透過鑽石馬鎧與新材質合成（例：將鑽石馬鎧與黃玉合成即可獲得黃玉馬鎧）</li>\n</ul><hr><hr><p>___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">願您享受More Ores In ONE！我們將持續更新並維護本模組！</span><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">-TheLuigiplayer &amp; KiritoGames20</span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>安裝方式：</strong></span></span></p><ol>\n<li>1. 在系統選單選擇<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">執行</span>並輸入<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">%appdata%</span></li>\n<li>2. 開啟<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">.minecraft</span>資料夾</li>\n<li>3. 進入<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">mods</span>子資料夾（若不存在請新建）</li>\n<li>4. 將下載的More Ores in ONE檔案放入<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">mods</span>資料夾</li>\n</ol><p><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#e74c3c\">（需Forge 37.0.31或更高版本！）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>權限說明：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">允許將本模組用於模組包並自由配置</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">允許在自製模組或資源包中新增對本模組的支援</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">允許發布展示本模組的截圖/影片</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">允許轉載/分流本模組，但必須註明Curseforge頁面及原始作者（KiritoGames20 &amp; TheLuigiplayer）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">允許私下使用原始碼進行修改並與朋友遊玩，但禁止發布修改版本</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>語言支援：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">已支援語言：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><em>美式英文 - 由 KiritoGames20 提供</em></span><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><em>德文 DE - 由 KiritoGames20 提供</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">法文 FR - 由 MrEzral 提供</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">西班牙文 ES - 由 mauriciolanda4 提供</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">俄文 RU - 由 RushanM&nbsp;提供</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">巴西葡萄牙文 BR<span style=\"font-style:italic\"> - 由 louiswdg 提供<br></span>波蘭文 PL<span style=\"font-style:italic\"> - 由 torteLxd 提供<br></span>中文 ZH <span style=\"font-style:italic\">- 由 Aikini 提供</span></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;若您的語言尚未被支援，但您願意協助我們，可以在 GitHub 上提交您語言的官方翻譯！我們也會將您列入貢獻名單。</span></p><ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">1. 若尚未擁有 GitHub 帳號，請先註冊一個</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">2. 前往：<a href=\"https://github.com/TheKiritoPlayer20/MoreOresInONE/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/TheKiritoPlayer20/MoreOresInONE/issues</a> 並點擊「<strong>新增問題</strong>」</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">3. 點擊「<strong>翻譯</strong>」中的「<strong>開始使用</strong>」</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">4. 現在您可以將原始英文名稱替換為您的翻譯</span></li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>其他官方模組頁面：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252fforge-1-14-4-more-ores-in-one-community-mod-adds-ores-in-the-overworld-nether-amp-end%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/themes/modern/planetminecraft_logo.png\"></span></a></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/2978946-forge-1-14-4-more-ores-in-one-community-mod-adds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/3/3f/Minecraft_forums_logo.png/280px-Minecraft_forums_logo.png?version=0338d881ed167d5af4d8d51eccce0393\" alt=\"\" width=\"228\" height=\"115\"></span></a></p>",
